  ================================================================
  READ THIS BEFORE LOADING INTO ELEMENT451
  ================================================================
  The 2026-2027 catalog is currently published as a DRAFT. Its own page states:

    "**THIS IS A DRAFT VERSION. THE 2026-2027 CATALOG WILL BE FINALIZED
      ON SEPTEMBER 1, 2026.**"

  Every page in this catalog carries "**DRAFT**" in its title. If you ingest it
  now, AskBSU will answer program requirement, tuition and policy questions from
  a draft that BSU expects to change before September 1. For a student choosing
  courses, that is a real risk.

  Options, in order of preference:
  1. Hold this file until after September 1, 2026, then load it. Lowest risk.
  2. Load it now AND add a knowledge source instructing the bot to state that
     2026-2027 catalog information is draft until September 1 and to advise
     students to confirm with their advisor or DegreeWorks. Acceptable if
     students need Fall 2026 answers before September.
  3. Re-verify after September 1 regardless. The catoid should stay 22 when the
     draft is finalized, but confirm, and confirm the navoids too. If BSU
     publishes the final version as a new catalog rather than promoting the
     draft, the catoid will change and this file will need regenerating.

  ================================================================
  WHY THIS IS NOT A FIND-AND-REPLACE OF THE 25-26 FILE
  ================================================================
  Acalog identifies catalogs and pages by numeric id, not by year string. The
  year never appears in the URL. Between the two catalogs:

    catoid  20 -> 22
    navoids 2600-series -> 3000-series, all different, not offset by a
            constant, and not in the same order

  A search-and-replace of "25-26" or "20" would have produced a file of URLs
  that either 404 or silently resolve to the wrong catalog. Every id below was
  read from the live 2026-2027 nav.

  ================================================================
  ALSO NOTE
  ================================================================
  The 2025-2026 catalog (catoid=20), which the previous sitemap pointed to, is
  now labeled "[ARCHIVED CATALOG]" by BSU. If you have that file loaded in
  Element451, it is feeding the bot an archived catalog. Decide whether to keep
  it for students still on the 25-26 requirements or retire it.

  Scope: top-level narrative and content pages only, matching the previous
  file's approach. Individual program and course detail pages are not listed.
  Use generate-bsu-catalog-sitemap.js to enumerate those.
-->
